{0 awskit-eio}

Direct-style Eio runtime adapter for Awskit.

The public entrypoint is {!module:Awskit_eio}. Operations use plain result
values in direct style, while response bodies remain scoped to the runtime
callback.

Applications own HTTPS transport policy, TLS configuration, CA roots, RNG
initialization, and platform policy. Pass an explicit HTTPS connector for normal
AWS endpoints, and use the plaintext helpers only for intentional local tests.
